  "question": {
    "text": "The power dissipated (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>watt</mi></math>) in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> resistance in the following circuit is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0001_170637d7ccc6.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 190px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "0.75",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0001_e446f7ed8a4f.jpg\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 430px;\" /><br /><br />From circuit, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0001_43d34f7af7f8.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 150px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>∥</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math><br /><br />The internal resistance of battery <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math><br /><br />So, the equivalent resistance of circuit<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=2</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=3</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math><br /><br />The current in the battery,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>.5</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=1.5</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><br />Current in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> &nbsp;is,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.5</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><br />The power dissipated in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> resistance,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.75</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>"
  }
